\f1\fs22 While Sarah was getting much too familiar with Johnny, Chanta rearranged a pyramid of empty bottles on a rickety table. He ground his teeth, and hurled ninja stars with his eyes at Johnny, who was looking crazier all the time. But crazy is a relative term, which became apparent when three stick-insect men with long white beards approached Sarah\'92s booth, wearing the kind of hooded onesies wizards might wear to bed.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Excuse me, dear lady,\'94 an old, elongated man addressed Sarah, wearing what looked like a deep-purple child\'92s pyjama onesie, festooned with golden stars, ringed planets, and rainbows that seemed to emerge from the armpits, groin, and, yes, butthole.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah blinked and hoped it would help shunt the gears of her gummed-up brain into overdrive. Her first feeling was one of relief. Even this guy and his two familiars behind him were an improvement on Johnny\'92s hurt pride.\
